This product includes or downloads at run time the following third party work:

- all-MiniLM-L6-v2 sentence embedding model by the sentence-transformers authors, Apache License 2.0.
  Downloaded from the Hugging Face Hub when the models first run.
- Geologica and Martian Mono typefaces, SIL Open Font License 1.1, bundled with the web app.
- The Tranco list of popular domains (https://tranco-list.eu), described in Le Pochat et al.,
  "Tranco: A Research-Oriented Top Sites Ranking Hardened Against Manipulation", NDSS 2019.
- IP to ASN data from iptoasn.com, published under the Public Domain Dedication and License.
- Published IP ranges from Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud, Microsoft Azure, Oracle Cloud,
  Cloudflare, Fastly and DigitalOcean.

Incident data is collected from the public status pages of the services listed in
catalog/services.yaml. It belongs to those services. Mercalli links every incident back to the
vendor's own page, and its published dataset carries titles, timings and statuses rather than the
text of vendor updates.
